{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# SU(3) chain [3,1,0] ⊗ [3,1,0], L = 2 — untwisting the normalized scalar product\n\nThis notebook repeats `SU3_L2_Untwisting.wb` (both sites in the adjoint [2,1,0]) for both sites in the **15 = [3,1,0]**. The object is the same:\n$$\n\\frac{\\langle L_A|R_B\\rangle}{\\langle L_A|0\\rangle\\langle0|R_B\\rangle}=C_{\\rm vac}\\,\\frac{\\det N^{AB}}{c_A^{\\rm ref}\\Psi_B^{\\rm ref}},\\qquad z_j=e^{\\varepsilon\\varphi_j},\\ \\sum_j\\varphi_j=0,\\ \\varepsilon\\to0 .\n$$\n\n$15\\otimes15=60\\oplus42\\oplus24^{\\oplus2}\\oplus21\\oplus15^{\\oplus2}\\oplus15'\\oplus6\\oplus\\bar3$: 225 states and 10 highest-weight states. The weights are $(6,2,0),(5,3,0),(5,2,1)^{\\times2},(6,1,1),(4,4,0),(4,3,1)^{\\times2},(4,2,2),(3,3,2)$.\n\n**Parts of the adjoint notebook that change with the representation:**\n- $\\nu_i(u)=\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s-\\lambda_i)$ with $\\lambda=(3,1,0)$. The poles of $M=1/(\\nu_1\\nu_2\\nu_3)$ are $\\theta_s+\\{0,1,3\\}$, so they are no longer consecutive.\n- Twisted degrees: $\\deg q_i=6-\\mu_i$, $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j$. Untwisted staggered degrees: $\\deg q_i=(6-\\lambda_i)+(i-1)$, $\\deg q^j=\\lambda_j+(3-j)$.\n- The H/O column basis, the divergence powers $k_A$ and $E_\\lambda$ are **re-derived** here, not copied.\n\nSymbols carry the suffix `F` so that nothing collides with the adjoint notebooks (suffix `U`) in a shared kernel.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. gl(3) [3,1,0] generators and the L=2 chain; twist enters only through TcoF. ---- *)\nClearAll[repF, dsF, dcF, idF, EEF, E1F, E2F, EtotF, thetaF, lamSiteF, TmonF, qminorAtF, qcoF, buildChainF, TcoF,\n  nu1F, nu2F, nu3F, qdetF, u];\n\n(* GT machinery: identical to the adjoint notebooks (rank- and rep-independent, memoized per rep). *)\nps[rr_] := ps[rr] = Block[{res = Prepend[rr, #] & /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rr[[1, i + 1]], rr[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rr[[1]]] - 1}]]},\n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rr_] := dim[rr] = Length[ps[{rr}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rr_] := JJ[k, l, rr] = Which[\n    k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rr}]],\n    l == k + 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l == k - 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rr].JJ[k + 1, l, rr] - JJ[k + 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k + 1, rr],\n    l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rr].JJ[k - 1, l, rr] - JJ[k - 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k - 1, rr]];\n\nrepF = {3, 1, 0};\nlamSiteF = repF;\ndsF = dim[repF];\ndcF = dsF^2;\nidF = IdentityMatrix[dsF, SparseArray];\nEEF[i_, j_] := EEF[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, repF]];\nE1F[i_, j_] := E1F[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[EEF[i, j], idF];\nE2F[i_, j_] := E2F[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[idF, EEF[i, j]];\nEtotF[i_, j_] := E1F[i, j] + E2F[i, j];\n\nTmonF[i_, j_][x_] := Sum[\n   ((x - thetaF[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcF, SparseArray] - E1F[k, i]).\n    ((x - thetaF[[2]]) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcF, SparseArray] - E2F[j, k]), {k, 3}];\n(* Principal quantum minor at an exact point; its u-coefficients follow by exact interpolation\n   (nodes 1..2|I|+1, avoiding 0^0), which avoids symbolic 225x225 matrix products. *)\nqminorAtF[II_, x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TmonF[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1)], {k, Length[II]}],\n   {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nbuildChainF[th_] := (thetaF = th;\n   Do[With[{d = 2 Length[II]},\n     With[{vals = Table[qminorAtF[II, n], {n, 1, d + 1}], vinv = Inverse[Table[n^k, {n, 1, d + 1}, {k, 0, d}]]},\n      Do[qcoF[II, k] = SparseArray[Sum[vinv[[k + 1, n]] vals[[n]], {n, 1, d + 1}]], {k, 0, d}]]],\n    {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}] & /@ Range[3])}]);\n(* Exact for exact z; numeric for numeric z. *)\nTcoF[a_, k_, z_List] := Sum[(Times @@ z[[II]]) qcoF[II, k], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n\nnu1F[x_] := Product[x - th - lamSiteF[[1]], {th, thetaF}];\nnu2F[x_] := Product[x - th - lamSiteF[[2]], {th, thetaF}];\nnu3F[x_] := Product[x - th - lamSiteF[[3]], {th, thetaF}];\nqdetF[x_] := nu1F[x - 2] nu2F[x - 1] nu3F[x];\n\n(* Chain point P1 as in the adjoint notebook; h = 1 is hard-coded in the shifts. *)\nbuildChainF[{1/3, -8/57}];\n\nWith[{zt = {5/2, 7/3, 6/35}, zero = ConstantArray[0, {dcF, dcF}], uu = 13/7},\n Grid[{\n   {\"dim [3,1,0], chain\", Row[{dsF, \", \", dcF}]},\n   {\"minor interpolation check at u = 13/7 (all 7 index sets)\",\n    And @@ Table[Normal[Sum[qcoF[II, k] uu^k, {k, 0, 2 Length[II]}] - qminorAtF[II, uu]] === zero,\n      {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}] & /@ Range[3])}]},\n   {\"T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = {5/2,7/3,6/35})\",\n    And @@ Flatten@Table[Normal[TcoF[a, k, zt].TcoF[b, l, zt] - TcoF[b, l, zt].TcoF[a, k, zt]] === zero,\n       {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {l, 0, 2 b}]},\n   {\"T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u), lambda = (3,1,0), unimodular twist\",\n    And @@ Table[Normal[TcoF[3, k, zt]] === Coefficient[Expand[qdetF[u]], u, k] IdentityMatrix[dcF], {k, 0, 6}]},\n   {\"zero twist: T_a commute with total gl(3)\",\n    And @@ Flatten@Table[Normal[TcoF[a, k, {1, 1, 1}].EtotF[i, j] - EtotF[i, j].TcoF[a, k, {1, 1, 1}]] === zero,\n       {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]}\n   }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752601\" data-output-id=\"32\" data-out-n=\"285\" data-sub-idx=\"30\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"53\" data-sub-end=\"67\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[285]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim [3,1,0], chain</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minor interpolation check at u = 13/7 (all 7 index sets)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = {5/2,7/3,6/35})</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u), lambda = (3,1,0), unimodular twist</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">zero twist: T_a commute with total gl(3)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord\">225</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[285]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{dim [3,1,0], chain} & 15\\text{, }225\\\\\\hline\\text{minor interpolation check at u = 13/7 (all 7 index sets)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T1, T2 coefficients commute (z = \\{5/2,7/3,6/35\\})} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u), lambda = (3,1,0), unimodular twist} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{zero twist: T\\_a commute with total gl(3)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "923a2e29-1b63-4414-92d3-8ab9de1d9ead"
