   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Status: stopped here (2026-09-16)\n\n- **Section 12 (the cell above) is incomplete.**\n  - `SdiagF` has **no solution**: no diagonal $S$ with $E_{ji}=S^{-1}E_{ij}^TS$ exists in this GT basis for [3,1,0], unlike the adjoint. So `S2F` and the $\\|r_0\\|_S^2$ column are meaningless.\n  - The rest of that cell is valid: the exact $\\mathcal B_A/\\mathcal B_{\\rm vac}$ is $\\omega$-independent and even in $t$, and at $t=9/19$ it matches the physical limit to $2\\times10^{-19}$.\n- **Not done:** the $t$-dependence fits, the normalization of bare eigenvectors, and the separate right/left limits (adjoint cells 17 and 19).\n- **Kernel state after this cell:** the chain sits at $\\theta=(2/7,0)$, the last `tValsF` value, not at P1. To use sections 4–10, rerun from the top.",
